# Spacing

**Reference**: `docs/patterns/ui-style-guidelines.md` (Spacing and Layout). Aligned with the 8wi design guide.

## Prefer Vuetify utilities

Use `pa-*`, `ma-*`, `mb-*`, etc. Do **not** add `theme.scss` rules that only restate Vuetify spacing.

## Vertical rhythm: `mb-*`, not `mt-*`

Put the gap on the **upper** element (`mb-4` between stacked fields/sections). Avoid `mt-*` for section rhythm (double-spacing bugs).

| Context | Spacing |
|---------|---------|
| Stacked form fields | `mb-4` (16px) |
| Section label → content | `mb-2` / `mb-3` on the label |
| Cards on a page | `mb-4` on each card |
| Alerts above content | `mb-4` |

## Control clusters: inline `gap`

Buttons, chips, and wrap toolbars:

```vue
<div class="d-flex align-center flex-wrap" style="gap: 8px">
```

**Switch rows** use the theme class (16px gap; pins switch width so spacing shows):

```vue
<div class="d-flex align-center flex-wrap switch-cluster">
  <v-switch inset color="primary" density="compact" hide-details="auto" … />
  <v-switch inset color="primary" density="compact" hide-details="auto" … />
</div>
```

| Cluster | Gap |
|---------|-----|
| Buttons / chips in a row | `style="gap: 8px"` |
| Switches in a row | class `switch-cluster` (16px) |
| Side-by-side form fields | class `field-row` (16px both axes) |

## Side-by-side fields: `field-row`

```vue
<div class="field-row mb-4">
  <v-select label="Screen" … />
  <v-text-field label="Dwell time (seconds)" style="max-width: 200px;" … />
  <div class="field-row__actions d-flex align-center" style="gap: 4px">
    <v-btn icon variant="text" size="small" …><v-icon size="small">mdi-close</v-icon></v-btn>
  </div>
</div>
```

- Children split the width evenly; cap one with `style="max-width: …px"` when it should stay narrow.
- Row-action clusters get `field-row__actions` so they sit at natural width.
- Stacks below `sm` **with no per-child margin** — the gap applies on both axes. Never add
  `mb-4 mb-sm-0` to a child; that is the double-spacing bug this class exists to prevent.

## Never use `v-row` / `v-col`

There is no remaining use in this codebase. Column gutters fight `mb-4` and leave zero
horizontal gap between auto-width controls.

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| `v-row` + `v-col` for a field pair | class `field-row` |
| `v-row justify="center"` + `v-col` to centre a card | class `page-narrow` on the `v-container` |

## Simple two-button pairs

Cancel + Save may use `class="mr-2"` on the first button **or** a parent `style="gap: 8px"`. Prefer the same pattern as the surrounding cluster.

## Do not

- Rely on `ga-*` / `gap-*` utility classes for critical layout
- Put adjacent interactive controls with no spacing
- Invent custom margin aliases in `theme.scss`
